cultural and political impact.</summary><category term="World" /></entry><entry><title>India's 'cockroaches' vs Election Commission: What you need to know ahead of CJP's October 10 protests</title><id>urn:rssync:entry:c8f2da0510a8083639e570a8fb8af8b5599559ee457f298e556f9cf81e22116f</id><updated>2026-10-09T21:02:25Z</updated><published>2026-10-09T12:23:00Z</published><link rel="alternate" href="../../../pages/www.dw.com/en/india-s-cockroaches-vs-election-commission-what-you-need-to-know-ahead-of-cjp-s-october-10-protests/a-79608760--fa9a4a7bb711.html" type="text/html" /><link rel="via" href="https://www.dw.com/en/india-s-cockroaches-vs-election-commission-what-you-need-to-know-ahead-of-cjp-s-october-10-protests/a-79608760?maca=en-rss-en-asia-5133-xml-mrss" /><summary type="html">The Indian capital New Delhi has been turned into a fortress with train and metro cancelations, barricades and heavy police presence ahead of Saturday's planned protests against the chief of India's electoral body.</summary><category term="World" /></entry><entry><title>Malaysia shuts schools amid toxic haze from Indonesian fires</title><id>urn:rssync:entry:e4628af89184c1a3ef97c567fec262767d6a57a6571fbc1bb292e1674820178f</id><updated>2026-10-09T21:02:25Z</updated><published>2026-10-09T06:39:00Z</published><link rel="alternate" href="../../../pages/www.dw.com/en/malaysia-shuts-schools-amid-toxic-haze-from-indonesian-fires/a-79607231--51c76e4ec588.html" type="text/html" /><link rel="via" href="https://www.dw.com/en/malaysia-shuts-schools-amid-toxic-haze-from-indonesian-fires/a-79607231?maca=en-rss-en-asia-5133-xml-mrss" /><summary type="html">Toxic smoke from forest fires in Indonesia has pushed air pollution to unhealthy levels, prompting authorities in Malaysia to take emergency measures.</summary><category term="News" /></entry><entry><title>India: Cockroach party denied permission to protest in Delhi, founder Dipke pushes on</title><id>urn:rssync:entry:0e4a272055896b761b99c3a3c0ff5be22d2383